notes = "Load a BREW pack: a .mod or .breq file with its .bar/.par files in the same folder. Prefer .breq so a front end does not hand the pack to a music player. Screen size comes from the content folder name (for example game-320x240) or the 'Screen size' core option; restart the content after changing it."

description = "A libretro core for QuoinHLE, a high-level emulator of the classic BREW application runtime (1.x-4.x). Guest ARM code runs for real; the host implements the AEE runtime."
